    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40186" root="نفخ" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفْخٌ</span></b>  [<i>Flatulence.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And hence,] (tropical:)  <i>Boastfulness;
arrogance; pride;</i> (S, K;) [<i>inflation with pride</i>]:
pride was termed by Mohammad <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفْخُ الشَّيْطَانِ</span>.
(TA, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">همز</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلٌ ذُو نَفْخٍ</span>, as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذو</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفْجِ</span>, (tropical:)  <i>A boastful, arrogant, proud man;</i> (S;)
[<i>a man inflated with pride</i>].

